# MedSimplify Full Feature Roadmap & Hugging Face AI Model Mapping Plan

This plan establishes the complete feature set categorized from `APP FEATURES.docx` across Patient and Doctor applications, specifies the exact Hugging Face AI models and pipelines for each feature, and details the end-to-end implementation roadmap.

---

## 🤖 Hugging Face AI Models & Pipeline Classification

| AI Feature | Task / Capability | Recommended Hugging Face Model | Local / Offline Fallback |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **1. Medical OCR & Document Digitization** | Image/PDF text extraction | `microsoft/trocr-base-printed` / `baidu-research/donut-base` | PyTesseract + PyMuPDF |
| **2. Biomedical NER & Entity Extraction** | Lab values, test names, ranges | `d4data/biomedical-ner-all` / `emilyalsentzer/Bio_ClinicalBERT` | SciSpacy (`en_core_sci_sm`) |
| **3. Medical Report Simplification & Summarization** | Medical jargon to plain English | `google/flan-t5-large` / `FacebookAI/bart-large-cnn` | Rules + T5-small |
| **4. "Explain Like I'm 5" (ELI5) Mode** | Ultra-simple elderly/child terms | `google/flan-t5-base` | Templated ELI5 Parser |
| **5. Regional Language Translation** | Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Spanish | `Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-hi`, `Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-mul` | Googletrans / MarianMT |
| **6. Voice Explanations (Text-to-Speech)** | Audio report playback | `facebook/mms-tts-hin` / `facebook/mms-tts-tam` | gTTS / Web Speech API |
| **7. AI Patient Health Assistant (Q&A Chat)** | 24/7 patient health questions | `microsoft/biogpt` / `mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2` | BioGPT / Flan-T5 |
| **8. AI Clinical Assistant & Red Flag Alerts** | Abnormality flagging & differential diagnosis | `emilyalsentzer/Bio_ClinicalBERT` + Classification Head | Rule Engine + Range Checker |
| **9. Symptom Trend Analysis & Insights** | Severity trend prediction | `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` | Trend Heuristics |

